In fact, it suffices to require $f_*\mathcal{O}_ X = \mathcal{O}_ S$ because the Stein factorization of $f$ is étale in this case, see More on Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma <a href="/tag/0E0D" data-tag="0E0D">76.36.9</a>. The condition may also be replaced by asking the geometric fibres to be connected, see Lemma <a href="/tag/0E6L" data-tag="0E6L">109.11.2</a>.